## Sample 3

**From:** Payroll Dept (payroll-updates@empl0yee-portal.net)
**Subject:** Direct Deposit Change Confirmation Needed

> Your direct deposit information was recently changed. If this wasn't you, click below to review and restore your original banking details within 24 hours or your next paycheck may be delayed.
>
> [Review My Account]

**Answer: PHISHING**
Red flags:
- Domain uses a zero for "o" (`empl0yee-portal.net`) — classic look-alike domain trick
- Urgency/fear (paycheck delay threat)
- Sensitive request (banking details) via unsolicited email link

