## Answer Key Summary Table

| Sample | Verdict | Primary Red Flag |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Phishing | Look-alike domain + urgency |
| 2 | Legitimate | Internal domain, specific context, no ask |
| 3 | Phishing | Look-alike domain + sensitive data request |
| 4 | Phishing (BEC) | Secrecy + urgency + gift card request |
| 5 | Phishing | Vague sender, no order reference, urgency |
| 6 | Legitimate | Internal domain, routine info, no action needed |

